  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": true,
    },
    "description": "Loads the Workspace and its Plugins and validates every Mission's Blueprint and Screenplay against them, as \`npm run check-workspace\` does. Reports each problem with its Mission, its file and where in the Blueprint, and each Cinematic's cinematography checks (F1, F3, C4, T4, lines with no shot, shots held past their lines), and what the game reads to open each Map Package (a DocumentHeader dependency DocumentInfo doesn't list and that isn't on disk fails, lists that otherwise differ warn; a version-39 MapInfo whose integrity hash its fields don't give fails). Each mod the config's mods names is checked too (its folder, Mod Blueprint, one mod package and compile record, and its DocumentHeader's dependencies against its DocumentInfo's), and that the Campaign Pack's Campaign Mod is one of them; such a problem names its mod. isError is set when there is any error; a warning, review item or note (severity) doesn't set it.",
