    "description": "Makes a Mission from a Map Package built outside the Workspace (Import, ADR-0010). Copies the package byte for byte to <missions>/<mission>/<Name>.SC2Map, never writing to the source, and writes a minimal Blueprint read from it (id, title, Campaign, setting, map size, tileset, dependencies, and the Screenplay reference when the Campaign's Screenplay Source knows the package's conversation, which is then pulled) and an empty compile record: everything in the package starts as Kept Content. The Blueprint has no Zones or Beats, so the layout checks skip and a compile leaves the terrain, map info and triggers as they are. The Editor's default map name is replaced with the title.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "properties": {
