    "description": "Captures a Doodad Composite recipe (DL-07) from a Map Package saved in the Galaxy Editor: the author builds a shape from stock doodads, draws a region round it and saves; the doodads inside the region become the recipe's members, relative to their middle. The recipe joins the Blueprint's composites, replacing one with the same id, and set pieces stamp it with { "composite": id }. The doodads stay in the map.",
