    },
    "description": "Makes a Workspace mod from a mod built outside the Workspace (Import, ADR-0011). Copies the unpacked .SC2Mod byte for byte to mods/<mod>/<Name>.SC2Mod, keeping its name, never writing to the source, and writes a minimal Mod Blueprint (id, kind and the dependencies its DocumentInfo lists) and an empty compile record: everything in the package starts as Kept Content, and the first compile changes nothing. The Workspace config's mods names it. The kind is campaign (a Campaign Mod: game data, triggers, cutscenes, UI) when the package has game data or triggers, else asset (an Asset Mod: art and audio files only), unless given. An Asset Mod's binaries (models, textures, audio, fonts) are tracked by Git LFS: the Workspace's .gitattributes gains the patterns it lacks.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
