    "description": "Imports a cinematic set into a Mission or a mod as data, at <its folder>/sets/<set id>.json (for a mod's Cinematics, mods/<id>/sets/), from the Cutscene Editor files where the set catalog (data/cinematic-sets) finds it: its pieces (model, transform, variation, tint), marks (each with its look-at at another mark), named cameras (orbit cameras, and target cameras converted to orbit values; a moving one at its first frame, marked moves), base Lights, lamps (one attached to a character attached to its mark) and its ambience (each Sound looping all through the file; other Sounds are listed as cues for a Cinematic's sounds), in the set's own frame, with the source file recorded. A Cinematic then compiles without the source files. It reads the set's richest occurrence among the sources, unless file names another. Importing again replaces the file.",
