    "description": "Reads one of a Mission's triggers, Kept in its Map Package or the Blueprint's own, back as write_blueprint_trigger's input: each function, parameter, block, preset value, global, member, trigger and type by the name the Editor shows it where that name settles on it, else by its reference, and each literal as a number, true/false or its text where it can be. The outline is the same whichever owns the trigger, so a Kept one reads as it will once converted. A Blueprint trigger's outline, edited or not, is given to write_blueprint_trigger to rewrite it (unchanged, it writes the same file); a Kept one is converted with convert_triggers first. What the input can't express is listed by place. The trigger is named by its name or element Id.",
