    },
    "description": "Lists the Kept leftovers of a Workspace mod that look safe to drop as Accepted Removals (ADR-0011), each with a reason, read from its package as the last compile left it: a ConversationStrings Conversation/… key that no GameData file names (a line or group the conversation no longer has), a strings file's line an old version-control merge conflict left (<<<<<<< .mine, =======, >>>>>>> …), and an empty GameData Assets.txt (an asset-key table that overrides nothing). Compiled items and those the Blueprint already removes are left out. Nothing is applied: show the author each one and add only those they confirm to the Mod Blueprint's removals, as { item, reason }, then compile_mod.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
