    "description": "Compiles a Mission in place, into its committed Map Package (as compile_map does by default), runs the Blueprint's declared route tests (tests.routes) on the generated terrain without the game and reports each as passed or failed, then plays it in the game through the Editor's Test Document. The route tests are static: nothing is read back from the running game yet. When the machine's Host Adapter can't run Test Document, it returns step-by-step instructions for the author instead. Ask the author to close the Mission in the Editor first: rewriting a map the Editor has open can crash it, and the Editor keeps testing the copy it loaded.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
