  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": true,
      "readOnlyHint": false,
    },
    "description": "Tunes Kept triggers and functions in the Mission's own Map Package (ADR-0010), changing each one's XML in Triggers and its Galaxy in MapScript.galaxy together, so Test Document runs the change without an Editor save. Edits, applied in order: set (a parameter's value in the form it has: a number, true/false or text; { preset: "<library>/<id>" }; { id } for a placed unit, point, region or camera; { trigger } for a trigger), remove (a call or comment) and copy (a call, after itself or \`after\`, with \`set\` giving the copy's parameters new values by the copied parameters' Ids). Ids come from outline_kept_trigger. A trigger is refused, naming each function or preset by library and id, unless the trigger catalog knows every one it uses; then edit it in the Editor and save there. It is refused too when the script's Galaxy for it isn't the Editor's for its XML (save in the Editor first), when it is Compiled Content, and while the Editor has the map open. All edits are checked before anything is written.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "properties": {
        "edits": {
          "description": "The edits, applied in order, each { op, trigger, ... }",
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "op": {
                    "const": "set",
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "param": {
                    "pattern": "^[0-9A-F]{8}$",
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "trigger": {
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "value": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "number",
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "boolean",
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "string",
                      },
                      {
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "preset": {
                            "pattern": "^\\w+\\/[0-9A-F]{8}$",
                            "type": "string",
                          },
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "preset",
                        ],
                        "type": "object",
                      },
                      {
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "maximum": 9007199254740991,
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "type": "integer",
                          },
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "id",
                        ],
                        "type": "object",
                      },
                      {
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "trigger": {
                            "minLength": 1,
                            "type": "string",
                          },
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "trigger",
                        ],
                        "type": "object",
                      },
                    ],
                  },
                },
                "required": [
                  "op",
                  "trigger",
                  "param",
                  "value",
                ],
                "type": "object",
              },
              {
